{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F2xkebj5jJWj6EASjBUBq1","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_1/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 60\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 选择 ALFWorld + Qwen3-1.7B 单环境验证 B-IAVR 核心假设\\\\n  rationale: ALFWorld 离散动作空间使 action_changed 信号最清晰，semantic canonicalization 简单（verb,object,receptacle三元组）。Qwen3-1.7B\\\\n    有充分 headroom（+8.6pp on ALFWorld）。MVP 只需验证\\\\\\\"agent 能学会选择性验证\\\\\\\"这一核心假设，不需要跨环境/跨模型。2×GPU\\\\n    足够 1.7B+LoRA 训练。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase A 使用全量微调（非 LoRA），匹配 Self-Guide 原始论文设置\\\\n  rationale: Self-Guide 原文用全量微调 GRPO。1.7B 模型在 94GB VRAM 下全量微调显存仅 38.5GB，完全可行。匹配 baseline\\\\n    设置确保公平对比。IDEA_BRIEF 提及 LoRA 是基于 H100 80GB 的资源估算，RTX PRO 6000 94GB 无需节省。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001\\\\n    role: Phase A baseline\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp003，Phase A bootstrap 失败确认，等待 invalid action 根因诊断后决定修复方向\\\\n  rationale: 'exp003 step 1: invalid_action=95.3%, pg_loss≈0, 每步 1.6h（100步=160h）。GRPO\\\\n    从 0.125% valid action 中无法获得有效学习信号。Qwen3 无独立 Instruct 版，Plan B 失效。需先诊断 invalid\\\\n    action 根因（格式冲突 / token 问题 / prompt 不兼容）再选修复路径。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: failed - bootstrap failure, 95% invalid actions, pg_loss≈0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采用方案 A（修改解析器适配 Qwen3 格式）+ prompt 增强 + 速度优化，解决 bootstrap 失败\\\\n  rationale: 根因确认：Qwen3-1.7B 原生输出 <think>...</think> 后直接跟自然语言，不生成 <answer> 标签。RAGEN\\\\n    解析器正则要求 <answer> 导致 95% invalid。方案 A 最快（1-2h 改代码）、最低风险（不换模型不加训练阶段），同时优化速度（关闭 collapse\\\\n    multi_turn 省 35% 步耗时 + 减 traj/step）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: '32/32 samples confirm: no <answer> tag in Qwen3 output'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp007 borderline 但不 pivot SFT，提高 LR 到 5e-6 重跑 GRPO\\\\n  rationale: exp007 step 10 action_is_valid=8.35%，技术上触发预设 kill 条件（<10%），但：(1) 趋势明确上升\\\\n    4.01%→8.35%（+0.48pp/step），线性外推 ~step 14 即突破 10%；(2) success 从 0%→6.25%，GRPO 确实在学习；(3)\\\\n    manager_invalid 6.46%→1.56%，解析器修复有效；(4) 崩溃是 /tmp 磁盘满（基础设施），非算法失败；(5) SFT warmup\\\\n    需额外收集 expert trajectories + 训练周期，开销大。因此override kill 条件，选择提高 LR（1e-6→5e-6）重跑 GRPO\\\\n    30 步，save_freq=5，同时修复所有基础设施问题（RAY_TMPDIR、/tmp 清理）。新 kill 条件：step 10 action_is_valid\\\\n    < 15%（因 LR 提高 5x，预期收敛更快）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp007\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: step 10 action_is_valid=8.35%, success=6.25%, 因磁盘满崩溃于 step 11, checkpoint\\\\n      全部丢失\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 撤回 exp008 (LR 5e-6)，改用 SFT warmup 再接 GRPO\\\\n  rationale: Agent 正确指出 action_is_valid 低的根因不是 LR 不够高，而是 Qwen3-1.7B 缺乏 ALFWorld 命令语义知识——92%\\\\n    的动作语法正确但语义无效（不是合法 ALFWorld 命令）。提高 LR 只能加速已有信号的收敛，无法从根本解决命令词汇缺失。SFT warmup 直接教模型\\\\n    ALFWorld 命令格式和语义，GRPO 再优化策略，是更高效的路径。SFT 计划已就绪（artifacts/sft_warmup_plan.md），总成本\\\\n    ~8h（SFT 2h + GRPO 6h），可接受。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp007\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10 步 action_is_valid 仅 8.35%，语法正确但语义无效，指向命令知识缺失而非学习速度问题\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp011，改 reward function（连续score+降format penalty+group_size 16），从\\\\n    step 5 checkpoint 恢复\\\\n  rationale: Reward 分析确认：format_penalty(-0.1/turn)在零成功 group 中劫持 GRPO 梯度，模型只学格式不学任务（action_is_valid\\\\n    68% + success 0%）。A1 连续 score 给部分完成的轨迹提供梯度信号；A2 降 format_penalty 到 -0.01 避免淹没任务信号；B1\\\\n    group_size 8→16 提高正信号 group 比例（32%→53%）。从 step 5 恢复因其仍有 1.6% success 残余。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp010\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: failed - reward analysis revealed format penalty hijacking GRPO gradient\\\\n  - exp_id: exp011\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: same reward config as exp010, will repeat collapse pattern\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 确认 exp010 reward shaping 分析正确；A2(降 format_penalty)为 P0，A1(进度奖励)需先验证\\\\n    infos[\\\\\\\"score\\\\\\\"] 粒度\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立验证了代码引用和根因诊断。新发现：env.py:137 未请求 score=True，AlfWorld 不同任务类型的\\\\n    score 粒度未知。A2（format_penalty→0 或 -0.01）风险最低——KL loss 已提供格式压力（SFT 模型 90% valid），penalty\\\\n    冗余且有害。exp011 从 step 10 恢复无 reward 修改=浪费算力，已在 D007 中 kill。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp010\\\\n    role: analysis_source\\\\n    result: failed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp011\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: wasteful_resume_from_step10\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 强制 pre-flight checklist：每次实验提交前必须验证入口点、磁盘、参数兼容性、checkpoint 路径\\\\n  rationale: 18 个实验仅 1 成功，多数失败为可避免的工程问题（错误入口点、磁盘满、格式不兼容）。exp012 再次因用错入口点（agent_proxy\\\\n    vs train.py）失败。引入 pre-flight checklist 防止此类重复失败。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: failed - wrong entry point\\\\n  - exp_id: exp007\\\\n    role: prior failure\\\\n    result: failed - disk full\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003\\\\n    role: prior failure\\\\n    result: failed - format incompatibility\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp012b（零梯度死锁），引入 dense reward shaping 设计 exp013，下调 MVP pass 标准至 success\\\\n    ≥ 20%\\\\n  rationale: 两位 Reviewer 独立确认：exp012b step 6-7 pg_loss=0, success=0%, pass@16=0%,\\\\n    advantages 全零。format_penalty=0 消除了组内 reward 方差，GRPO 无梯度信号。继续跑浪费 ~10.6 GPU-hours。核心问题是\\\\n    sparse binary reward + 弱基础模型 + GRPO 方差依赖 = 冷启动死锁。方向（SFT→GRPO）未被证伪，但需要 reward shaping\\\\n    打破死锁。76% MVP 标准不现实（Self-Guide 是非 RL 方法），下调至 20% 证明 GRPO 能学到有意义策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: zero gradient deadlock - pg_loss=0, success=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp010\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: format_penalty=-0.1 had success=4.7% but gradient hijacking\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sft\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: SFT taught format compliance but not task strategy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp012b（零梯度死锁确认），引入 dense reward shaping，下调 MVP pass 标准至 success ≥\\\\n    20%\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 确认：format_penalty=0 + binary reward + 0% success =\\\\n    零梯度死锁（pg_loss=0.0），模型完全不更新。exp010 的 format_penalty=-0.1 至少创造了 reward 方差但方向错误。根本问题是\\\\n    ALFWorld sparse binary reward + GRPO 在基础模型太弱时无法工作。解决方案：加 step-level dense reward\\\\n    shaping（子目标奖励），方向正确且创造梯度信号。76% 目标来自 Self-Guide 论文的非 RL 方法，30 步 GRPO 不可达，MVP pass\\\\n    下调至 success ≥ 20% + 明确上升趋势。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: step 6-7 train success=0%, pg_loss=0.0, 零梯度\\\\n  - exp_id: exp010\\\\n    role: 对照\\\\n    result: format_penalty=-0.1 时 step 1 success=4.7% 但后续崩塌\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sft\\\\n    role: 基础\\\\n    result: SFT warmup 成功，action_is_valid 68-72%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp013f negative: dense reward gaming — 下一步 success-gated bonus + 降低 bonus\\\\n    比例'\\\\n  rationale: exp013f 完成 30 步，dense reward (valid_action_bonus=0.15) 解决了 collapse（grad_norm\\\\n    稳定 1.7-8.15）但引发 reward gaming：action_is_valid 60%→97.5% 而 success 归零，score_max\\\\n    从 10+ 塌缩到 4.5。模型学会独立最大化 dense reward（29步×0.15=4.35）放弃高风险 success（10.0）。核心问题：dense\\\\n    reward 可被独立最大化。修复方向：(1) success-gated bonus 消除独立最大化路径 (2) 降低 bonus 到 0.01 测试弱信号是否足够\\\\n    (3) 前 N 步 warmup 后撤掉 bonus。优先级 exp014c > exp014a > exp014b。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp013f\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: negative - reward gaming\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: negative - catastrophic collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: D012 修订：放弃 success-gated bonus（bootstrap 问题），改走 sparse GRPO + 训练稳定性修复\\\\n  rationale: Success-gated bonus 在 success≈0% 时退化为 sparse reward，无法解决冷启动。而 exp012b\\\\n    step 6 success=8.59% 证明 sparse GRPO 有信号，collapse（grad_norm 1.48→0.09）可能是 LR 过高\\\\n    / KL 过低导致的单步更新过激，不是 reward sparsity。方案 B（sparse GRPO + 极低 LR 1e-7 + KL 0.1 + gradient\\\\n    clipping）直接解决 collapse 且不引入新 reward hacking 风险。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: step 6 success=8.59% proves sparse signal exists; collapse at step 7 was\\\\n      training instability\\\\n  - exp_id: exp013f\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: dense reward gaming confirms reward shaping risks\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp015（LR 1e-7 过保守，连续 3 步零梯度），启动 exp016 LR=5e-7 折中方案\\\\n  rationale: exp015 step 1-2 有梯度信号（pg_loss>0, success 3-5%），验证了 D013 的 collapse 修复。但\\\\n    step 3-5 连续零梯度，LR=1e-7 的参数更新量约 5e-12，模型行为无可观测变化。Kill 条件已满足。LR=1e-6（exp012b）collapse，LR=1e-7（exp015）不学习，取折中\\\\n    LR=5e-7 + 保留 KL=0.1 + grad_clip=1.0。从 exp015 step 5 checkpoint 恢复（保留 step 1-2\\\\n    的微小更新）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp015\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: kill - LR too conservative, 3 consecutive zero-gradient steps\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: LR 1e-6 collapsed at step 7\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp016 — reward function 完全失效，12 步零 reward 信号，GPU 空转\\\\n  rationale: exp016 step 12/30，所有 step 的 raw_reward/advantages/returns 均为 0。Step 7\\\\n    出现 4.7% success 但 reward 仍为 0，说明 reward function 未正确将 success 映射到 reward。grad_norm\\\\n    ~0.85 仅来自 entropy loss，模型无 policy gradient 信号。疑似 checkpoint resume 后 reward config\\\\n    丢失。继续运行浪费 GPU。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp016\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: killed — reward function broken\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pivot to Expert SFT warmup — GRPO 在 base success ~1-2% 下无法工作，LR 搜索区间穷尽\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 分析确认：exp016 step 7 pg_loss=0.000151 证明 reward function\\\\n    本身可用，但 7 步中仅 1 步有 success（14%），步骤 8-12 连续 5 步零梯度。反推 base success rate ~1-2%，GRPO\\\\n    在此 sparsity 下无法产生有效学习。LR 搜索已覆盖 1e-6（collapse）→ 5e-7（无效学习）→ 1e-7（零梯度），区间穷尽。Pivot\\\\n    到 expert SFT：用 ALFWorld HandCodedTWAgent 收集的 expert trajectories（当前 ~61-70%）做\\\\n    SFT warmup，将 base success 提升到 10-15% 后再上 sparse GRPO。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp016\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 6/7 steps zero gradient, base success ~1-2%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp015\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: LR=1e-7 zero gradients after step 3\\\\n  - exp_id: exp012b\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: LR=1e-6 catastrophic collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: D015 误诊纠正 — reward pipeline 正常，exp016 失败原因是 base success 太稀疏（1/8 步有信号）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 逐行核实 exp016.log：Step 7 critic/score/mean=0.46875（= 3/64 × 10.0）、critic/score/max=10.0、pg_loss=0.000151、grad_norm=2.0，reward\\\\n    function 完全正确。Agent 报告的 raw_reward=0 来自 es_manager 的 info.get('raw_reward', 0.0)\\\\n    日志 artifact，ALFWorld env info 不含此 key。NaiveRewardManager 检测到 rm_scores 后 pass-through，agent_trainer.py:779\\\\n    不是覆写。D016 Expert SFT pivot 仍成立，理由修正为 base success ~4.7%（仅 1/8 步有 success）太稀疏。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp016\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: reward pipeline confirmed working; killed due to sparse success, not bug\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp017 eval 5% success（低于 10% 阈值），采用方案 B+C：修复数据格式 + 从 exp008_sft checkpoint\\\\n    继续微调\\\\n  rationale: 'exp017 SFT eval: 5% success (1/20)，format_ok 从 100% 降至 75%，action_is_valid\\\\n    从 90% 降至 63.8%。25% episodes parse 失败（1 步退出）。expert trajectory 格式与 RAGEN <think>/<answer>\\\\n    不完全匹配，SFT 学到任务知识但破坏了 format 合规性。方案：(1) 修复 expert data 格式对齐 RAGEN template (2)\\\\n    从 exp008_sft checkpoint 开始微调（已有 100% format_ok），用较低 LR 防止遗忘 format。预计 ~1.5h。方案\\\\n    A（直接 GRPO）信号改善极小（5% vs 4.7%），方案 D 工程量太大。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp017_expert_sft\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 5% success, format_ok 75%, below 10% threshold\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sft\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 0% success but 100% format_ok, 90% action_is_valid\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp019 — move→put 替换方向错误，admissible_commands 中是 move 不是 put\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 确认：ALFWorld handcoded expert 代码 5 种任务类型全部用 \\\\\\\"move {}\\\\n    to {}\\\\\\\" 检查 admissible_commands，RAGEN env.py action_is_available 检查 action in admissible_commands。fix_expert_sft_format.py\\\\n    将 2157 条正确的 \\\\\\\"move\\\\\\\" 替换为 \\\\\\\"put in/on\\\\\\\"，教模型产生不在 admissible_commands 中的动作，会进一步恶化 action_is_valid。正确修复方向：保留\\\\n    \\\\\\\"move\\\\\\\" 原样，在 observation 中添加 admissible actions 列表后缀。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp019_e\\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 31377 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 43377, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bf3YMntj2XK9keSYK6Y7hQ","session_id":"865e8d8a-d167-43f7-87ae-b7ba5c42080f","uuid":"8900002c-b535-4af5-ab33-b0f537c72928","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:01:06.072Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GcMWcaTzsyUUJow1bY6Fpk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M8ccfgPjsRhMzeCytoYGzb","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer R2 for a top ML venue (acceptance rate ~25%, 6-point scale: 1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept).\n\nYour focus: **Novelty, positioning, related work coverage, and significance**.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\"Learning When to Verify: RL-Trained Selective Self-Verification for Multi-Turn Interactive Agents\"\n\nThree claims:\n1. Dual mechanism (sign misattribution + info loss) diagnosis of step-independent GRPO failure for multi-turn agents.\n2. Episode-level credit, not finer per-token credit, is the key for sparse-reward multi-turn RL (GAE ≈ episode-level GRPO).\n3. B-IAVR selective verification: 58% verification cost reduction, only -2pp success loss.\n\n### Related Work Coverage (Section 2)\nThe paper covers four areas:\n- **Multi-turn RL for LLM agents**: RAGEN, Turn-PPO, GAGPO (93.5% ALFWorld), MT-GRPO, iStar, ArCHer, HiPER (97.4% ALFWorld). Positions itself as \"opposite direction\" from finer credit.\n- **Self-verification/reflection**: ReflAct, Self-Guide (72.7% ALFWorld 1.7B), Reflexion. Says they are always-on; this paper addresses \"when to verify.\"\n- **Adaptive compute**: ARES (SFT router, 52.7% token reduction), Thinkless (RL binary token for reasoning). Says it shares RL-for-control philosophy but targets multi-turn verification.\n- **Credit assignment**: Zhang et al. survey, GAE. Uses GAE as baseline.\n\n### Key Results\n- ALFWorld episode-level GRPO: 47.8%±3.1pp (5 seeds). Step-independent h=2: 2%.\n- GAE(λ=1.0): 39% vs episode-level GRPO 38% at step 15 (indistinguishable).\n- B-IAVR: 46% success, 42% verification rate, 52% cost reduction. Pareto-dominates confidence-threshold, random, ARES.\n- ScienceWorld transfer: 3.2× episode/step ratio.\n- 7B scaling: ratio increases from 2.7× to 3.6×.\n- Absolute performance: 48% ALFWorld, far below GAGPO 93.5% and HiPER 97.4%.\n\n### Limitations (stated by authors)\n- Absolute performance 48% far below SOTA (GAGPO 93.5%, HiPER 97.4%).\n- Contribution is diagnostic/methodological, not performance-focused.\n- Selective verification tested on only two environments.\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nProvide a detailed review covering:\n\n1. **Novelty Assessment**:\n   - Is the dual mechanism diagnosis genuinely new? Turn-PPO already identified the \"uniform advantage\" problem. What is the incremental contribution?\n   - Is the \"episode-level info matters more than finer credit\" finding surprising or expected?\n   - Is B-IAVR (action-change reward for verification routing) a significant methodological contribution?\n   - How does this compare to Thinkless which also uses RL for binary control tokens?\n\n2. **Related Work Adequacy**:\n   - Are key competitors properly cited and discussed?\n   - Is the positioning honest given the huge performance gap (48% vs 93.5-97.4%)?\n   - Are there missing references?\n\n3. **Significance and Impact**:\n   - Who benefits from this work? Practitioners or researchers?\n   - Is the contrarian \"coarser is better\" finding likely to influence the field?\n   - Is the B-IAVR component likely to be adopted?\n\n4. **Claim Validity vs. Framing**:\n   - Does the paper overclaim? Are the contributions fairly stated?\n   - Is the \"finer credit is unnecessary\" claim too strong given the limited setting (sparse binary rewards)?\n   - The paper says GAGPO/HiPER use \"finer-grained credit assignment and larger models\" — is this a fair characterization?\n\n5. **Weaknesses**: Be specific. Classify as (major) or (minor).\n\n6. **Questions for authors**: 3-5 specific questions.\n\n7. **Preliminary Score**: X/6 with justification.\n\nFormat your review as a structured document with headers. Be thorough but fair."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44613,"cache_read_input_tokens":24213,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44613},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"865e8d8a-d167-43f7-87ae-b7ba5c42080f","uuid":"4b854211-1ca1-465c-94f4-626b1b6f18a3"}
