{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QkDjNGQokrspk6sa4hQin5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tdream_id: dream_20260516T235255\n2\tproject: cost-verify-agent-rl\n3\tvenue: ''\n4\tfocus: 'Evaluate dual contribution (episode-level training methodology + selective\n5\t  verification). Key uncertainty: will episode-level training converge high enough\n6\t  (≥40%) to support cost-efficiency story? Is the episode-level insight novel enough\n7\t  standalone?'\n8\treview_mode: full\n9\treview_visible: true\n10\twriting_visible: true\n11\twhat_if: []\n12\ttier_definitions:\n13\t  tiers:\n14\t    best:\n15\t      tier: best\n16\t      meaning: Episode-level训练收敛至≥45%，selective verification完整验证，dual contribution成立\n17\t      key_assumptions:\n18\t      - Episode-level GRPO在continued training中突破40%阈值并稳定收敛\n19\t      - h-sweep展示清晰的单调退化+sharp cliff，机制分析compelling\n20\t      - Action-change作为intrinsic reward有效训练selective policy\n21\t      - B-IAVR在verification↓40%+的同时success delta<3pp\n22\t      - Multi-seed复现std<5pp\n23\t      number_ranges:\n24\t        episode_level_success_rate:\n25\t        - 45\n26\t        - 60\n27\t        step_independent_baseline:\n28\t        - 0\n29\t        - 6\n30\t        h_sweep_cliff_threshold:\n31\t        - 5\n32\t        - 10\n33\t        selective_verification_rate_reduction:\n34\t        - 40\n35\t        - 60\n36\t        selective_vs_always_on_success_delta_pp:\n37\t        - 0\n38\t        - 3\n39\t        action_change_confirmatory_rate_pct:\n40\t        - 60\n41\t        - 80\n42\t        multi_seed_std_pp:\n43\t        - 1\n44\t        - 5\n45\t        action_is_valid:\n46\t        - 90\n47\t        - 98\n48\t      narrative_direction: '原始dual-contribution framing完全成立。Story: step-independent\n49\t        RL在multi-turn agent上灾难性失败→episode-level解决credit assignment→在此基础上action-change\n50\t        reward训练selective verification→near-always-on performance at 40-60% lower\n51\t        cost。两个contribution互相支撑，Claim 1是enabling methodology，Claim 2+3是downstream\n52\t        application。'\n53\t    median:\n54\t      tier: median\n55\t      meaning: Episode-level收敛至30-42%，selective verification效果有限，需rebalance为methodology-heavy\n56\t        paper\n57\t      key_assumptions:\n58\t      - Episode-level训练收敛但未大幅超过40%阈值（borderline区间）\n59\t      - h-sweep大体展示预期趋势但存在噪声（某些h值不完全单调）\n60\t      - Selective verification可训练但cost-performance tradeoff不dramatic\n61\t      - Action-change signal存在但correlation moderate（r=0.15-0.25）\n62\t      - Multi-seed有一定variance（std 5-8pp）\n63\t      number_ranges:\n64\t        episode_level_success_rate:\n65\t        - 30\n66\t        - 42\n67\t        step_independent_baseline:\n68\t        - 0\n69\t        - 6\n70\t        h_sweep_cliff_threshold:\n71\t        - 3\n72\t        - 8\n73\t        selective_verification_rate_reduction:\n74\t        - 15\n75\t        - 35\n76\t        selective_vs_always_on_success_delta_pp:\n77\t        - 3\n78\t        - 8\n79\t        action_change_confirmatory_rate_pct:\n80\t        - 55\n81\t        - 75\n82\t        multi_seed_std_pp:\n83\t        - 5\n84\t        - 8\n85\t        action_is_valid:\n86\t        - 85\n87\t        - 93\n88\t      narrative_direction: Rebalance为70% training methodology + 30% selective verification。Claim\n89\t        1保持strong（episode vs step-independent的gap仍然dramatic），但Claim 2+3降级为'preliminary\n90\t        evidence'或'proof-of-concept'。Paper主打：episode-level training是被忽视的关键设计选择，selective\n91\t        verification作为downstream application demo而非co-equal contribution。需要加厚Phase\n92\t        C ablation（h-sweep做得更细、mechanism analysis更深）来补偿Phase B的弱结果。Title可能调整为更强调methodology。\n93\t    worst:\n94\t      tier: worst\n95\t      meaning: Episode-level收敛停滞在20-30%，selective verification无法有意义地执行，需完全reframe为pure\n96\t        methodology paper\n97\t      key_assumptions:\n98\t      - Episode-level训练plateau在20-30%（高于baseline但远不够支撑cost story）\n99\t      - Success rate不足以让selective verification有统计意义上的对比空间\n100\t      - h-sweep仍能展示episode-level vs step-independent的gap，但绝对性能不impressive"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01M8ccfgPjsRhMzeCytoYGzb","session_id":"865e8d8a-d167-43f7-87ae-b7ba5c42080f","uuid":"c1ff6f7a-7a54-4153-9c14-81b403a24fc0","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:02:17.053Z"}
